      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A prolific researcher by the name of Spencer "Spence" Coulter (renowned
    for his contributions to American innovation, though equally controversial for
    his role in the creation of several WMDs during the war-time of the 2040''s)
    has, for all intents and purposes, gone a bit haywire.


    There are 5 main
    segments of this puzzle; a Keypad that requires a 4-digit code, a 9-dial-radio
    that, once set to the correct sequence, will transmit the 4-digit code in English,
    and 3 basic puzzles that, once solved, will help you figure out the necessary
    sequence for the radio.


    Since you selected (difficulty) mode, you have
    # minutes to solve this puzzle. Good Luck.'
